          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Biliha na Zilipa kūbyala baana",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Laheli aho wabona gīkī atūmyalīlaga baana ū Yakobo, ūng'wītīla wilu ū nkūlūye; ūng'wīla ū Yakobo gīkī, “Ninhage baana; ūlū ītī chene nakūcha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yakobo akapelana no; ūng'wīla, “Bebe ū nene nalī ha ng'wanya gwa ng'wa Mulungu ūyo wakūhangīja ūleke kūbyala baana?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Laheli ūhaya, “Ūūyū aha lūūlū ū Biliha ū nsese wane. Laalaga nang'hwe anibyalīle nane baana, napandīke kaya kūbītīla mulī we.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ūng'winha ū Biliha ū nsese wakwe gīkī antoole. Ū Yakobo ūlaala nang'hwe ng'hana; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūngita nda, ūmyalīla ng'wana ngosha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Laheli ūhaya, “Ū Mulungu oolecha gīkī natī ng'hūbi; wigwa ū kūlīla kwane ūninha ng'wana ngosha.” Kūlwa nguno yenīyo ū ng'wana ūng'wilīka ī lina Dani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nsese wa ng'wa Laheli ūbūūcha nda hangī, ūbyala ng'wana ngosha wa kabīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūkangala lwenūlo ū Laheli ūhaya, “Nalī na wilwisha būtaale no nū nkūlū wane; nose natinda.” Ū ng'wana ūng'wilīka Nafutali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Leya aho wabona gīkī ooya ū kūbyala, ūnsola ū nsese wakwe ū Zilipa, ūng'winha ū Yakobo abize nke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nsese wa ng'wa Leya ū Zilipa ūmyalīla ū Yakobo ng'wana ngosha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Leya ūhaya, “Lyūba mbande;” ūng'wilīka Gadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nsese wa ng'wa Leya ū Zilipa ūmyalīla ū Yakobo ng'wana wa kabīlī ngosha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Leya ūhaya, “Nalī na būyegi no ī haha; a bakīma bakūyūnihaya nalī na mbango.” Ūng'wilīka ī lina lyakwe Asheli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu makanza g'igesa, ū Lubeni akaja kū malaale, ūkabona dūdai",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30:14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Dūdai:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mitī milebe ī miji yaaho īkalyiagwa na banhū ba sī jimò.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ūng'wenhela ū nina ū Leya. Ū Laheli ūnomba ū Leya alīhaya, “Ninhage nane shi ī dūdai ja ng'wana wako!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Leya ūng'wīla gīkī, “Ū bebe ūtaalī ūnikūūbīlīja dūhū gashi, ū ngosha wanitaaja, nī dūdai ja ng'wana wane ūtogilwe ūsole!” Ū Laheli ūnshokeja gīkī, “Ka nahene ndūhū ū mhayo shi lūūlū, nizunīlījage nasole ī dūdai, ū būjikū bo lelo akūlaala mu ng'wako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mhīndī ya lūshikū lwenūlo aho wiza ū Yakobo kūfuma ū kū malaale, ū Leya ūnsūmbīīla akūng'wīlaga, “Ī lelo ūlīlaala mu ng'wane naakūgoodishaga na dūdai ja ng'wanone.” Ng'hana ū lūshikū lwenūlo ūlaala mu ng'wa Leya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mulungu ūng'wigwa, ūbūūcha nda, ūmyalīla ū Yakobo ng'wana ngosha wa katanò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Leya ūhaya, “Ū Mulungu waninong'ha kūlwa kūng'winha ū nsese wane kūlī ngoshi wane.” Na lūūlū ūng'wilīka ī lina Isakaali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Leya ūbūūcha nda hangī, ūmyalīla ū Yakobo ng'witūnja wa katandatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Leya ūhaya, “Ū Mulungu waninha inong'ho lya mpango no; nalībona lūūlū ū lūkangala ūlū ū ngoshi wane akūnikondela, nguno nashisha baana batandatū nakūmyalīlaga.” Na lūūlū ūng'witana Zabuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma y'ikanza ūbyala na ng'wanikī, ūng'wilīka ī lina lyakwe Dina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Mulungu ūng'wizūkwa nū Laheli; ūng'wigwa ūnugūlīla būbyīle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbūūcha nda ūbyala ng'wana ngosha; ūhaya gīkī, “Ū Mulungu wanīngīja ū būdalahwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūng'wilīka ī lina lyakwe Yosefu; ūhaya gīkī, “Ū SEEBA ni anongejage ng'wana ūngī ngosha.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būsabi bo ng'wa Yakobo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Laheli aho wamyala ū Yosefu, ū Yakobo ūng'wīla ū Labani gīkī, “Nizunīlījage lūūlū nane naje kaya kū sī ya ng'wise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūninhe na a bake bane, abo naabapandīka kūlwa kūkūtūmamīla; pye na a baana bane, naje kaya. Bebe wīmanile ī milīmo īyo naakūtūmamīla.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Labani ūng'wīla, “Ūlū ūlizunīlīja nū būlombi wane, igashaga hamò nane. Nguno naawīlilwe na balagūji gīkī ū SEEBA akūnīīlūkīlaga ī jenīji kūlwako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ongeja kūhaya gīkī, “Hayaga ī mheela īyo ūtogilwe, nakūkwinha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yakobo ūng'wīla, “Bebe ng'wenekīlī ūmanile ūmo naakūtūmamīlile, nū mumo jakwīlīlile ī mitugo jako kūlwa nguno ya būlang'hani wane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho naliza jalī ngehu no, alīyo ī haha jilī ningī; būlī kwene ūko nakūpīndīlaga ū SEEBA akūkwinhaga mbango. Ali lūūlū ī gīsī, ū nene nakwīlonja nanalī ī mihayo ya kaya yane?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Labani ūbūja, “Ī gīsī ūlībona nakwinhe kī?” Ū Yakobo ūshosha, “Ūtizūninha kīnhū shose shose, alīyo ūlū ūnīītīla gūyū mhayo gūmò, nakongeja kūkūdīīmīla nū kūgalang'hana a madaale ga mitugo jako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nizunīlījage ī lelo nabīte ū mu madaale, naje nakūjisolanhyaga pyī ī ng'holo ja mabbado nī ja būgondo būgondo, na a baana ba ng'holo a bapi. Nī mbūlī ī ja mabbado nī ja būgondo būgondo. Ī yenīyo h'ībize mheela yane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būtūngīlīja wane būkūnikaanīla nūūlū kū shikū ja kū būtongi, ūlū wiza kūniloja ī mheela yane īyo ūlīninha. Ūlū yīlonga mo mbūli yose yose ītī ya mabbado nūūlū ītī ya būgondo būgondo, īkūbalwa gīkī ya kwiba, pye nūūlū ng'wana wa ng'holo dūhū ūyo atī wapi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Labani ūshosha, “Nazunyaga n'ījage gīt'umo wahayīla.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū lūshikū lwenūlo, ū Labani ūjīsolanhya pyī ī ng'hulyati nī mbūli ī ng'hīma ī ja mabbado nī ja būgondo būgondo (nī ja mabbado gaape), pyī nī ng'holo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30:35",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ng'holo:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū baana ba ng'holo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ī japi. Ūjīsaamya, ūjitūūla mu makono ga bitūnja bakwe bajilang'hane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūjilekanya nī ja ng'wa Yakobo, ūjitwala būūkūle bo lūgendo lwa kūshimīza shikū idatū; ī mitugo ījo jikasaaga jikala mu makono ga ng'wa Yakobo, akūndīīmīlaga ū Labani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yakobo ūbbuta matambī mado mado ga mitī ya magobeko na milozi na migude. Aho gataalī madoto būl'itambī ūlyītīla mabbado mabbado gape, akūlībbatūlaga a magūūla gwigela ū ntī ū mu gatī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a matambī genayo ūyūgatūūla ū mu malambo ga kūng'wisīja, gaabiza kū būtongi wajo ī mitugo ūlū jilīng'wa minzī. Ījo jilī ng'wikanza lya kūpandwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jūyūpandwa bbihī na a matambī genayo. A baana ūlū jabyala babiza ba mikwanga mikwanga, ba mabbado na ba būgondo būgondo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yakobo ūyūjikomanya ījo jilībyalwa, wajitūūla heeke. Hama pyī ī ja ng'wa Labani wajikangīīlaga ū kū ja mikwanga mikwanga nī japi, ījo jalī ū ng'widaale. Nang'hwe ūpandīka idaale lya mitugo jakwe mu gīko, ūyūjitūūla ipandī lyajo heeke, walī atajisangījaga nī ja ng'wa Labani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būl'ikanza lya kūpandwa ī mitugo ī ngīlīng'hanu ūlū lyashika, ū Yakobo wagatūūlaga a matambī genayo ū mu malambo, gīkī ūlū jilipanda jibize hihī nago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī mitugo ūlū jilī nyagokolo, walī atagatūūlaga mo a matambī genayo. Ū mu gīko ī mitugo ī ngokolo jūbiza ja ng'wa Labani; alīyo ī ngīlīng'hanu jūbiza ja ng'wa Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ng'wenūyo ūsaba kīngī nasho, ūbiza na madaale mataale ga mitugo, na basese bagosha na bakīma; hamò na ngamīla na nzobe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
